# Pull Request Information

- **PR #**: 1271
- **URL**: https://github.com/IstiN/dmtools-agents/pull/1271
- **Title**: fix(config): remove dead DEFAULT_CONFLUENCE and internal MODULE_PREFIXES export (#1265)
- **Author**: IstiN
- **Branch**: `fix/gh-1265-dead-code-config` → `main`
- **State**: open
- **Files Changed**: 2
- **Additions**: +27
- **Deletions**: -10
- **Created**: 2026-10-26T15:13:38Z
- **Updated**: 2026-10-26T15:13:38Z

## PR Description

## Summary
- Remove unused duplicate `DEFAULT_CONFLUENCE` constant and its export from `js/config.js` (default Confluence URLs are already defined and used in `js/configLoader.js`).
- Remove internal-only `MODULE_PREFIXES` from `module.exports` in `js/config.js` while keeping `const MODULE_PREFIXES` internally for `SOLUTION_DESIGN_MODULES`.
- Add unit tests in `js/unit-tests/test_config.js` verifying `DEFAULT_CONFLUENCE` and `MODULE_PREFIXES` are not exported while `SOLUTION_DESIGN_MODULES` remains intact.

Closes #1265
=====
